<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head', { 
    title: 'Partner With Us & Services', 
    page: 'partner-with-us', 
    description: 'Partner with Club FuRN. We offer in-instance VRChat stream relays, multi-platform live streaming (Twitch/YouTube/TikTok), DJ talent booking, and network cross-promotion.',
    themeColor: '#29c5f6'
}) %>
<style>
    .services-2x2-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 20px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
        .services-2x2-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
    }
</style>
<body>

    <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px;">
        <%- include('partials/nav', { page: 'partner-with-us' }) %>

        <div class="logo-container">
            <img src="/cdn/logos/club/Logo.png" class="logo" alt="Club FuRN Logo">
        </div>

        <!-- HERO PITCH HEADER -->
        <div style="background: rgba(21, 30, 41, 0.9); border: 1px solid rgba(41, 197, 246, 0.4); border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; padding: 40px 30px; margin-bottom: 40px; box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); position: relative;">
            <div style="position: absolute; top: -50px; right: -50px; width: 250px; height: 250px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(41, 197, 246, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%); pointer-events: none;"></div>
            <div style="position: absolute; bottom: -50px; left: -50px; width: 250px; height: 250px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(242, 0, 141, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%); pointer-events: none;"></div>

            <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 20px; background: rgba(41, 197, 246, 0.1); color: var(--primary-blue); border: 1px solid rgba(41, 197, 246, 0.3); display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                Partnership & Broadcast Services
            </span>

            <h1 style="background: linear-gradient(45deg, #29c5f6, #f2008d); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 2.3rem; text-transform: none; text-align: left; border: none; padding: 0;">
                Collaborate, Stream & Grow with Club FuRN
            </h1>

            <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 820px; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: left;">
                We create bi-monthly premier VRChat rave experiences while empowering our partner clubs with cutting-edge broadcast infrastructure, multi-platform streaming, DJ talent booking, and cross-promotional reach.
            </p>

            <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                <a href="#direct-contact" class="btn-cc btn-primary" style="text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; padding: 10px 24px; font-weight: bold;">
                    Get in Touch &rarr;
                </a>
                <a href="#services-grid" class="btn-cc btn-secondary" style="text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; padding: 10px 24px;">
                    Explore Services &darr;
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- OUR DUAL VISION SECTION -->
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 40px;">
            
            <div style="background: rgba(21, 30, 41, 0.75); border: 1px solid rgba(41, 197, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 16px; padding: 25px; backdrop-filter: blur(10px);">
                <span style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--primary-pink); display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">Community Pillar</span>
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #fff; font-size: 1.2rem;">For Partygoers & Members</h3>
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #aaa; line-height: 1.6;">
                    Club FuRN is a dedicated home to share unforgettable rave experiences together once every couple of months. We bring together new and veteran DJs, maintaining high anticipation and energy without event fatigue.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div style="background: rgba(21, 30, 41, 0.75); border: 1px solid rgba(41, 197, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 16px; padding: 25px; backdrop-filter: blur(10px);">
                <span style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--primary-blue); display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">Technical Pillar</span>
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: var(--primary-blue); font-size: 1.2rem;">For Partner Clubs & Communities</h3>
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #aaa; line-height: 1.6;">
                    We operate as a service provider and collaborative partner. Whether you need stream relays for your VRChat world, live multi-platform broadcasts, or help filling DJ slots, we are here to support your team.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- SERVICES MATRIX GRID (SYMMETRICAL 2x2 GRID) -->
        <div id="services-grid" style="margin-bottom: 50px;">
            <div style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 25px;">
                <h2 style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; color: #fff; font-size: 1.6rem; border: none; padding: 0;">
                    What We Offer Our Partners
                </h2>
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #888;">
                    Technical, streaming, talent, and promotional support tailored for VRChat partner clubs.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="services-2x2-grid">
                
                <!-- SERVICE 1 -->
                <div style="background: rgba(12, 18, 25, 0.9); border: 1px solid rgba(41, 197, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; transition: transform 0.3s ease;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)'">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 900; color: #29c5f6; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">Stream Infrastructure</span>
                    <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #fff; font-size: 1.15rem; border: none; padding: 0;">
                        In-Instance Stream Relays
                    </h3>
                    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #aaa; line-height: 1.6;">
                        High-fidelity, low-latency audio/video stream relays configured directly for VRChat world players (Topaz, Kurasuta, ProTV). Ensures rock-solid stability for multi-instance events.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- SERVICE 2 -->
                <div style="background: rgba(12, 18, 25, 0.9); border: 1px solid rgba(242, 0, 141, 0.3); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; transition: transform 0.3s ease;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)'">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 900; color: #f2008d; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">Broadcasting</span>
                    <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #fff; font-size: 1.15rem; border: none; padding: 0;">
                        Multi-Platform Live Streaming
                    </h3>
                    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #aaa; line-height: 1.6;">
                        Simultaneous live broadcasting to <strong>Twitch</strong>, <strong>YouTube</strong>, and <strong>TikTok</strong>, bringing maximum off-platform exposure and audience growth to your club's special events.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- SERVICE 3 -->
                <div style="background: rgba(12, 18, 25, 0.9); border: 1px solid rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.3); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; transition: transform 0.3s ease;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)'">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 900; color: #9d4edd; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">Talent Pool</span>
                    <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #fff; font-size: 1.15rem; border: none; padding: 0;">
                        DJ & Talent Booking Assistance
                    </h3>
                    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #aaa; line-height: 1.6;">
                        Need DJs to fill your lineup? Access our roster of vetted underground performers spanning House, Trance, Hardstyle, Happy Hardcore, Synthwave, and custom B2B pairings.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- SERVICE 4 -->
                <div style="background: rgba(12, 18, 25, 0.9); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 158, 0, 0.3); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; transition: transform 0.3s ease;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)'">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 900; color: #ff9e00; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">Promotional Reach</span>
                    <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #fff; font-size: 1.15rem; border: none; padding: 0;">
                        Network Cross-Promotion
                    </h3>
                    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #aaa; line-height: 1.6;">
                        Get your club featured on the Club FuRN homepage banner, our dedicated `/partners` directory, custom `/partner/:slug` showcase page, and Discord event announcements.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- DIRECT CONTACT CARD FOR PROSPECTIVE PARTNERS -->
        <div id="direct-contact" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(21, 30, 41, 0.95), rgba(12, 18, 25, 0.95)); border: 1px solid var(--primary-blue); border-radius: 20px; padding: 35px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px; box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);">
            <h2 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #fff; font-size: 1.8rem; border: none; padding: 0;">
                Let's Partner Up
            </h2>

            <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: #cbd5e1; max-width: 650px; margin: 0 auto 25px auto; line-height: 1.6;">
                Interested in partnering with us or utilizing our broadcast, DJ booking, and streaming services for your club? Reach out directly to discuss how we can work together.
            </p>

            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                <a href="/discord" target="_blank" class="btn-cc btn-primary" style="text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem; padding: 12px 28px; font-weight: bold; background: #5865F2; border-color: #5865F2;">
                    Join Our Discord Community ↗
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <script src="/cdn/js/theme-engine.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
